Licensing of linux-hp-omnibook-5-glymur
=======================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Rahul Pon and contributors.

This repository holds several kinds of material, licensed to match where
each one goes. A file's own SPDX-License-Identifier line, where it has one,
takes precedence over this table. The full license texts are in LICENSES/.

  Path                                  License
  ------------------------------------  ---------------------------------
  dts/                                  BSD-3-Clause, as for Qualcomm's
                                        and the other laptop device trees
                                        in arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom
  patches/                              the license of the upstream file
                                        each patch modifies (GPL-2.0 for
                                        the Linux kernel)
  scripts/, boards/ (except firmware),  GPL-2.0-only, as the kernel these
  and all other code                    tools build and patch
  docs/, captures/, reference/, notes/  CC-BY-4.0
  and all other documentation
  boards/*/firmware/                    NOT covered: see below

Firmware
--------

The files under boards/hp-omnibook-5-16-bf1xxx/firmware/ are HP's and
Qualcomm's, copied unmodified from the driver pack HP publishes for this
laptop (provenance and hashes in that directory's README.md and
MANIFEST.tsv). They are not licensed by this repository; their owners'
terms apply. Do not add firmware from any other source.

Contributions
-------------

By contributing, you agree that your contribution is licensed under the
license that applies to the files it touches, as described above. See
CONTRIBUTING.md.
